<h1>🌿 CarbonTrust API</h1>
<p class="sub">Base URL: <code>http://localhost:3000/api</code> &nbsp;|&nbsp; Header Auth: <code>Authorization: Bearer {token}</code> &nbsp;|&nbsp; WS: <code>ws://localhost:3000</code></p>

